<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42003" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rūmĭnātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis,f.
		ruminor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a chewing over again</i>, <i>chewing
				the cud</i>, <i>rumination.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animalium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 37, 79, § 201</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Serv. Verg. E. 6,
			54</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a doubling; a
				repetition</i>, <i>return</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corticis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 23, 25, § 94</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hiemis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					17, 22, 35, § 191</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a thinking over</i>,
				<i>revolving in the mind</i>, <i>ruminating</i>, <i>rumination</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cotidiana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 2, 12, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
